  <li><a href="/category/crm/">All open-source CRMs</a></li>
  <li><a href="/compare/mailchimp-vs-mailerlite-vs-listmonk-vs-mautic/">Mailchimp vs MailerLite vs listmonk vs Mautic</a>, for the marketing side of HubSpot</li>
  <li><a href="/alternatives/netsuite/">Open-source NetSuite alternatives</a>, if you need ERPNext next to Frappe CRM</li>
  <li><a href="/compare/hetzner-vs-digitalocean-vs-vultr/">Hetzner vs DigitalOcean vs Vultr</a>, for picking the server</li>
</ul>
</div></section>
